{"id":"616353","name":"红薯梗馅饼","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/616353/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"冷冻的红薯梗","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"一棵"},{"name":"纯净水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红薯梗解冻备用。","img":"images/616353/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"剁碎，挤出多余水分，放入盆中。","img":"images/616353/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"剥好的葱，洗净，切碎。","img":"images/616353/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把葱放在红薯梗上面。","img":"images/616353/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量盐和少许五香粉，浇一小勺热油，拌匀即可。","img":"images/616353/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一半凉水和面，一半温水和面，用筷子搅拌成絮状，醒15分钟，揉成光滑面团。","img":"images/616353/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搓成长条状，切成大小均匀剂子。","img":"images/616353/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀成圆薄饼。","img":"images/616353/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包入馅料。","img":"images/616353/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再擀成薄圆饼。","img":"images/616353/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"平底锅烧热，放入饼胚。","img":"images/616353/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"小火慢烙。","img":"images/616353/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"翻面，烙至两面金黄色即可。","img":"images/616353/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"对半切开，方便食用，香味扑鼻，醉了。","img":"images/616353/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}